334	**`DependentChanges`:** `List<DiffLineModel>` initialized to an empty list in the constructor and populated exclusively by `DiffService.ClassifyChanges` (Step 6) before the result is returned to callers. The mutable `List<T>` type is intentional — it allows `ClassifyChanges` to append dependents efficiently via `Add()` without copying. Callers receiving `DiffLineModel` instances from `GetPluginsDiffAsync` should treat `DependentChanges` as read-only; no production code path mutates it after `ClassifyChanges` returns.
